# Root-level orientation only. Service-specific examples live in backend/frontend.
#
# Backend: backend/.env.example
# Frontend: frontend/.env.example
#
# For the current local demo setup, enable both sides of the first filter:
# - backend: SLATE_DEMO_ACCESS_ENABLED=true
# - frontend: VITE_DEMO_ACCESS_GATE=true
#
# AI location recommendation also uses:
# - backend: OPENAI_API_KEY and optional SLATE_LOCATION_IMPORT_* values
# - frontend: VITE_KAKAO_MAP_APP_KEY
